s.\nView fees\nScholarships\nWhether you are looking for financial support to start your studies at ANU or help to move away from home for the first time, we have scholarship opportunities for you and your situation.\nExplore all ANU scholarships\ntoc\nSend an enquiry\nHow to apply\nNeed more information?\nSend us an enquiry and we'll get back to you within 48 hours\nEnquire\nFacebook Instagram YouTube Twitter LinkedIn Flickr\nBack to top\nAcknowledgement of Country\nThe Australian National University acknowledges, celebrates and pays our respects to the Ngunnawal and Ngambri people of the Canberra region and to all First Nations Australians on whose traditional lands we meet and work, and whose cultures are among the oldest continuing cultures in human history.\nContact ANU\nCopyright\nDisclaimer\nPrivacy\nFreedom of Information\nAccessibility\nTEQSA Provider ID: PRV12002 (Australian University)\nCRICOS Provider Code: 00120C\nABN: 52 234 063 906\nMember of\nHome\nAbout\nDirector's welcome\nOur culture\nHistory\nProfessor Anton. L. Hales\nProfessor John Conrad Jaeger\nProfessor Alfred Edward Ringwood\nDr Germaine Anne Joplin\nOur School Directors\nJaeger-Hales Lecture\nAnnual reports\nOutreach\nStrategic planning\nAwards\nStudy\nBachelor degrees\nHonours\nMaster degrees\nPhD & MPhil\nCourses\nStudent projects\nStudent profiles\nScholarships & prizes\nPrizes\nScholarships\nSummer Research Scholarships & Internships\nField trips\nWork experience\nResearch\nOur research\nResearch projects\nResearch impact: Case studies\nFacilities and infrastructure\nResearch stories\nPeople\nAll people\nFaculty\nAcademics\nHonorary Academics\nStudents\nProfessional staff\nEmeritus academics\nNews & events\nNews\nEvents\nRSES school seminar series\nRSES student seminar series\nGiving\nEarth Sciences Future Fund\nGeological Collections\nScholarships\nHow to give\nContacts\nGeneral enquiries\nFuture students enquiries\nAlumni\nCurrent students\nIntranet", "links": [["Skip to main content